{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"余骨架"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"余骨架"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 $n\\geq -1$, 单纯集 $X_\\bullet$ 的 $n$ 阶余骨架 $\\operatorname{cosk}_n X_\\bullet$ 是满足如下条件的单纯集:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{sk}_n Y,X)\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}(Y,\\operatorname{cosk}_n X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Kan复形","text":"Kan 复形"}},{"Plain":"的余骨架是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov 塔"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"模型"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\operatorname{cosk}_{-1}X=1$. (因为 $\\operatorname{sk}_{-1}Y=0$.)</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{cosk}_0 X$ 是 $X_0\\to 1$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cech脉","text":"Cech 脉"}},{"Plain":", 即 $(\\operatorname{cosk}_0X)_n\\simeq X_0^{n+1}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$n$ 阶余骨架的 $n$ 维及以上同伦群平凡.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}